# Client-side environment variables only.
#
# LAIDE Studio does not currently require any build-time or client-side
# environment variables to run. LLM provider API keys (OpenAI, Anthropic,
# Google, etc.) are entered by the user at runtime via the in-app Settings
# panel and stored locally — they are never read from .env files.
#
# Optional dev-server flag (not a client env var, only affects `npm run dev`):
# DISABLE_HMR=true
